o help develop the Coils specifically to help reclaim her humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div>To a degree. I think the saving grace of that branch is &quot;All the benefits of humanity and Kindred with none of the downsides&quot; which is something the Ordo can easily see as one of the logical endpoints. Well that, and it had/has the backing of one of the Brides which makes it extra hard to get it declared as heresy.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-09T09:53:24-08:00","id":826897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/826040-heretical-coils-of-the-ordo?p=826894#post826894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To a degree. I think the saving grace of that branch is &quot;All the benefits of humanity and Kindred with none of the downsides&quot; which is something the Ordo can easily see as one of the logical endpoints. Well that, and it had/has the backing of one of the Brides which makes it extra hard to get it declared as heresy.</div> </div> </div> </div> &quot;The Coils of Ziva, which is considered heretical amongst the dragons due to its goal of turning back to humanity. A similar Mystery existed in first edition 